    <item>
      <title>Agri-QA Agent: Separate Retrieval, Routing, and Evidence</title>
      <link>http://127.0.0.1:1318/en/ai-lab/engineering/agri-qa-architecture/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://127.0.0.1:1318/en/ai-lab/engineering/agri-qa-architecture/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Agri-QA is a completed agricultural question-answering prototype. It assigns domain retrieval, goal-oriented routing, and evidence citation to separate responsibilities instead of sending every question through one unbounded generation step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;request-path&#34;&gt;Request Path&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;div class=&#34;rich-code-frame&#34; data-rich-code data-rich-code-language=&#34;text&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;rich-code-toolbar&#34;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&#34;rich-code-language&#34;&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;rich-code-copy&#34; data-rich-code-copy&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;rich-code-body&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;rich-code-highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Question
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  -&amp;gt; intent route
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  -&amp;gt; domain retrieval or general answer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  -&amp;gt; evidence-aware response
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  -&amp;gt; citation and confidence display&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;textarea class=&#34;rich-code-source&#34; data-rich-code-source hidden readonly&gt;Question
  -&amp;amp;gt; intent route
  -&amp;amp;gt; domain retrieval or general answer
  -&amp;amp;gt; evidence-aware response
  -&amp;amp;gt; citation and confidence display&lt;/textarea&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Python / FastAPI defines the service boundary, LangGraph models query routing and tool flow, ChromaDB stores the vector index, and SQLite stores prototype conversation history. The public project description does not provide independently verifiable production SLAs or model evaluations, so this record makes no accuracy, throughput, or scale claims.&lt;/p&gt;
